Help                                                ●
Keys
tab, j, k      move between the rows (shift+tab goes
               back)
enter          edit the row: a text box, or a list to
               pick from
p              radio presets: they fill the four
               radio rows and the path hash
y              send it all to the node, check it, and
               restart the node
esc            back to the boards (keeps what you
               typed)
In a text box:
j/k scroll  space page  any other key back